{"seq":3,"slug":"exact-guarantees","title":"精确遗忘保证","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/machine-unlearning/exact/exact-guarantees","wordCount":1776,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"精确遗忘保证\">精确遗忘保证</h1><p>「精确」这个词容易给人一种万事大吉的错觉——仿佛只要方法是精确的，遗忘就彻底完成、再无隐患。本文要做的恰是给这个词去魅：精确遗忘到底向你承诺了什么，又默默放过了什么；为什么在深度非凸模型上精确路线几乎只剩 SISA 一条；以及为什么即便拿到了精确保证，你仍然可能有数据泄漏。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>本篇要拆解「精确」这个词，先把它的关键词定清楚。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>精确保证（exact guarantee）</strong>：承诺遗忘后模型与「从未见过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>f</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 训练出的模型」同分布（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo><mover><mo><mo>=</mo></mo><mi>d</mi></mover></mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\stackrel{d}{=}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.153em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.153em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">=</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.5669em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）。注意它只承诺分布层面不可区分，不承诺 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>f</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的信息在世界上消失。</li>\n<li><strong>同分布 ≠ 同参数</strong>：精确定义要求的是两个分布相等，而非某一次输出逐参数相同。这正是 SISA 允许换随机种子重训分片的依据。</li>\n<li><strong>间接关联（indirect association）</strong>：能从保留集 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 里推断出的关于被删对象的信息。这类残留不在精确遗忘的射程内，是它最大的盲区。</li>\n<li><strong>闭式解（closed form）</strong>：对凸问题，删一条数据后的新最优解可解析算出；深度网络非凸，没有闭式解，精确遗忘只能退回到「真的重训」。</li>\n<li><strong>实现精确 ≠ 算法精确</strong>：精确是算法的数学性质，生产系统仍可能有 bug 与侧信道（缓存、日志、检查点），故仍需经验验证兜底。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>理解这几点，就能读懂精确保证到底向你承诺了什么、又默默放过了什么。</p>\n<h2 id=\"精确保证的确切内容\">精确保证的确切内容</h2><p>精确遗忘的全部承诺，浓缩在一个分布等式里（见 <a href=\"../foundations/unlearning-definitions\">遗忘的定义</a>）：遗忘后模型与「从未见过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>f</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 训练出的模型」同分布。把这句话的边界划清楚很重要。它承诺的是：任何只能观察最终模型的攻击者，无法区分「这个模型遗忘过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>f</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>」和「这个模型从没学过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>f</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>」。它<strong>没有</strong>承诺的是：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>f</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 里的信息从此在世界上消失。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>精确保证承诺</th>\n<th>精确保证不承诺</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>遗忘后模型 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo><mover><mo><mo>=</mo></mo><mi>d</mi></mover></mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\stackrel{d}{=}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.153em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.153em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">=</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.5669em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 重训模型</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>f</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的信息绝对不可恢复</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>黑盒攻击者无法区分二者</td>\n<td>训练日志/检查点里不留痕迹</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对最终参数的影响被移除</td>\n<td>通过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 间接关联的信息被移除</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数学上可证明</td>\n<td>实现无侧信道泄漏</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最微妙的是最后那条「间接关联」。如果被删用户的信息可以从保留集 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 中其他强相关样本推断出来，那么即使你完美遗忘了 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>f</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 本身，模型仍可能「知道」关于这个用户的事——因为那些知识来自 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，不在遗忘范围内。精确遗忘对此无能为力，这类残留属于更深的隐私问题，见 <a href=\"../practice/unlearning-in-practice\">落地与边界</a> 对残留知识的讨论。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么深度模型只剩-sisa\">为什么深度模型只剩 SISA</h2><p>线性模型和凸优化问题上，精确遗忘有多种优雅解法——因为凸问题的最优解唯一，删一条数据后的新最优解可以解析地算出来。但深度神经网络的损失曲面高度非凸，训练结果依赖随机初始化、数据顺序、批次划分等一长串随机因素。这带来一个根本障碍：你无法在不重训的前提下，写出「删掉 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>f</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 后训练会收敛到哪里」的闭式表达。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[想要精确遗忘] --&gt; B{模型是凸的吗}&#10;    B --&gt;|凸 线性| C[新最优解可解析计算&lt;br/&gt;无需重训]&#10;    B --&gt;|非凸 深度网络| D[训练路径依赖随机性&lt;br/&gt;无闭式解]&#10;    D --&gt; E{怎么办}&#10;    E --&gt; F[全量重训&lt;br/&gt;精确但最贵]&#10;    E --&gt; G[分片重训 SISA&lt;br/&gt;精确且可控成本]&#10;    E --&gt; H[放弃精确&lt;br/&gt;转近似遗忘]&#10;    F --&gt; I[第2章 重训基线]&#10;    G --&gt; J[第2章 SISA]&#10;    H --&gt; K[第3章 近似]\">graph TD\n    A[想要精确遗忘] --&gt; B{模型是凸的吗}\n    B --&gt;|凸 线性| C[新最优解可解析计算&lt;br/&gt;无需重训]\n    B --&gt;|非凸 深度网络| D[训练路径依赖随机性&lt;br/&gt;无闭式解]\n    D --&gt; E{怎么办}\n    E --&gt; F[全量重训&lt;br/&gt;精确但最贵]\n    E --&gt; G[分片重训 SISA&lt;br/&gt;精确且可控成本]\n    E --&gt; H[放弃精确&lt;br/&gt;转近似遗忘]\n    F --&gt; I[第2章 重训基线]\n    G --&gt; J[第2章 SISA]\n    H --&gt; K[第3章 近似]</pre><p>这张图道出了精确遗忘在深度时代的处境：非凸性堵死了「解析地算出新解」这条路，于是精确遗忘只能退回到「真的重新训练」的物理操作上。而真的重训，要么全量（贵到不可行），要么 <a href=\"sharded-sisa\">分片 SISA</a>（把重训局部化）。除此之外，任何号称「不重训也精确」的深度模型方法，几乎都在某处偷换了「精确」的定义——这是审读论文时的一条实用警报。</p>\n<h2 id=\"随机性与-同分布-的工程含义\">随机性与「同分布」的工程含义</h2><p>精确定义要求的是分布相等，不是单次输出相等，这点在工程上有反直觉的后果。SISA 重训一个分片时，会用新的随机种子——所以遗忘后的子模型与「原本就没那条数据」的子模型，具体参数几乎肯定不同，但它们采样自同一分布。这正是精确性要的：分布层面不可区分，而非逐参数相同。</p>\n<p>反过来说，如果有人坚持「遗忘后必须得到和原模型几乎一样的参数」，那他要的根本不是精确遗忘——他要的是近似遗忘里「最小扰动」那一类目标，与精确定义南辕北辙。把这两种诉求混为一谈，是实践中常见的需求误判。理解「同分布 ≠ 同参数」，才能正确解读 SISA 为何允许换种子重训。</p>\n<h2 id=\"验证-精确也需要被检验\">验证：精确也需要被检验</h2><p>一个常被忽略的点：拿到精确保证，不代表你不需要验证。精确是对<strong>算法</strong>的数学性质，但你的<strong>实现</strong>可能有 bug、可能有侧信道（缓存、日志、检查点没清）。证明算法精确，和证明你的生产系统精确，是两回事。因此即使是精确遗忘，部署时仍要跑经验验证——用成员推断攻击确认遗忘后模型在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>f</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 上确实表现得像没学过它。这把精确方法也拉回到 <a href=\"../practice/membership-attacks\">成员推断验证</a> 的审判台前：理论保证负责「设计上对」，经验验证负责「实现上真的对」。</p>\n<p>值得强调的是，精确方法在经验验证下应当稳稳过关——如果一个号称精确的实现被 MIA 轻易攻破，那不是 MIA 太强，而是实现漏了某处。这种「理论与经验互为校验」的关系，是负责任遗忘流水线的基本素养。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>精确保证承诺的是「遗忘后模型与从未学过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>f</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的模型同分布」，不承诺 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>f</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 信息从世界上消失。</li>\n<li>最大盲区是间接关联：能从保留集 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 推断出的关于被删对象的信息，不在精确遗忘的射程内。</li>\n<li>深度网络的非凸性堵死了「解析算新解」，精确遗忘只能退回真重训——全量或分片 SISA。</li>\n<li>精确要的是「同分布」而非「同参数」；要求遗忘后参数几乎不变其实是近似遗忘的诉求，别混淆。</li>\n<li>精确算法仍需经验验证：算法精确 ≠ 生产实现精确，侧信道与 bug 要靠 MIA 等手段兜底。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本 hub 内：<a href=\"sharded-sisa\">分片 SISA</a> 是这套保证的唯一可控成本实现；<a href=\"../approximate/influence-based\">基于影响函数</a> 展示放弃精确、改求 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>ϵ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>δ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(\\epsilon,\\delta)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 认证的另一条路。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：间接关联与分布外泄漏的更广背景见 <a href=\"../../ai-safety-alignment/robustness/distribution-shift\">分布漂移</a>；安全去能力对「彻底性」的要求见 <a href=\"../../ai-safety-alignment/safety-foundations/safety-evaluation\">安全评估</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"精确遗忘保证","id":"精确遗忘保证"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"精确保证的确切内容","id":"精确保证的确切内容"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么深度模型只剩 SISA","id":"为什么深度模型只剩-sisa"},{"level":2,"text":"随机性与「同分布」的工程含义","id":"随机性与-同分布-的工程含义"},{"level":2,"text":"验证：精确也需要被检验","id":"验证-精确也需要被检验"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"分片 SISA","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/machine-unlearning/exact/sharded-sisa"},"next":{"title":"梯度上升遗忘","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/machine-unlearning/approximate/gradient-ascent"}}